9":"(disant) que : « N’","41:14:10":"adorez (pas)","41:14:11":"sauf","41:14:12":"Allâh ! »,","41:14:13":"ils ont dit :","41:14:14":"« Si","41:14:15":"avait voulu","41:14:16":"notre Maître,","41:14:17":"Il aurait certainement fait descendre","41:14:18":"des anges.","41:14:19":"Nous (sommes) donc","41:14:20":"en ce (avec) quoi","41:14:21":"vous avez été envoyé","41:14:22":"avec lui","41:14:23":"des mécréants. »","41:15:1":"Donc, quant à","41:15:2":"ʿÂd,","41:15:3":"alors ils sont devenus orgueilleux","41:15:4":"sur","41:15:5":"la terre","41:15:6":"sans (en avoir)","41:15:7":"le droit","41:15:8":"et ont dit :","41:15:9":"« Qui (est)","41:15:10":"plus fort","41:15:11":"que nous","41:15:12":"(en) puissance ? »","41:15:13":"Et est-ce que ne pas","41:15:14":"ils ont vu","41:15:15":"qu’","41:15:16":"Allâh,","41:15:17":"Celui qui","41:15:18":"les a créés,","41:15:19":"(est) Lui","41:15:20":"plus fort","41:15:21":"qu’eux","41:15:22":"(en) puissance ?","41:15:23":"Et ils déniaient tout en sachant","41:15:24":"[en] Nos Versets","41:15:25":"déniaient tout en sachant.","41:16:1":"Nous avons donc envoyé","41:16:2":"contre eux","41:16:3":"un vent","41:16:4":"violent","41:16:5":"dans","41:16:6":"des jours","41:16:7":"(de) misères","41:16:8":"afin de les faire goûter","41:16:9":"(au) châtiment","41:16:10":"(de) la disgrâce","41:16:11":"dans","41:16:12":"la vie","41:16:13":"(de) l’ici-bas.","41:16:14":"Et certainement (le) châtiment","41:16:15":"(de) l’au-delà","41:16:16":"(est) plus fort en disgrâce.","41:16:17":"Et ils","41:16:18":"ne","41:16:19":"recevront (pas) d’aide contre leurs ennemis.","41:17:1":"Et quant à","41:17:2":"Thamoûd,","41:17:3":"alors Nous les avons guidés","41:17:4":"mais ils ont préféré","41:17:5":"l’aveuglement","41:17:6":"à","41:17:7":"la guidance,","41:17:8":"les a donc frappés","41:17:9":"(le) coup de tonnerre","41:17:10":"(du) châtiment","41:17:11":"humiliant","41:17:12":"pour ce qu’","41:17:13":"ils acquéraient","41:17:14":"ils acquéraient.","41:18:1":"Et Nous avons sauvé","41:18:2":"ceux qui","41:18:3":"ont cru","41:18:4":"et craignaient avec piété","41:18:5":"craignaient avec piété.","41:19:1":"Et (Le) Jour (où)","41:19:2":"seront assemblés","41:19:3":"(les) ennemis","41:19:4":"(d’)Allâh","41:19:5":"vers","41:19:6":"Le Feu","41:19:7":"et ensuite ils","41:19:8":"seront restreints.","41:20:1":"Jusqu’à-ce que,","41:20:2":"quand","41:20:3":"quand","41:20:4":"ils arriveront (chez) lui,","41:20:5":"témoigneront","41:20:6":"contre eux","41:20:7":"leurs ouïes","41:20:8":"et leurs vues","41:20:9":"et leurs peaux","41:20:10":"de ce qu’","41:20:11":"ils faisaient","41:20:12":"ils faisaient.","41:21:1":"Et ils diront","41:21:2":"à leurs peaux :","41:21:3":"« Pourquoi","41:21:4":"avez-vous témoigné","41:21:5":"contre nous ? »","41:21:6":"Elles diront :","41:21:7":"« Nous a fait parler","41:21:8":"Allâh,","41:21:9":"Celui qui","41:21:10":"fait parler","41:21:11":"chaque","41:21:12":"chose. »","41:21:13":"Et Il","41:21:14":"vous a créés","41:21:15":"(la) première","41:21:16":"fois","41:21:17":"et vers Lui","41:21:18":"vous serez retournés.","41:22:1":"Et ne pas","41:22:2":"vous vous couvriez","41:22:3":"vous vous couvriez","41:22:4":"afin que ne pas","41:22:5":"témoigneront","41:22:6":"contre vous","41:22:7":"vos ouïes","41:22:8":"et pas (non plus)","41:22:9":"vos vues","41:22:10":"et pas (non plus)","41:22:11":"vos peaux","41:22:12":"mais","41:22:13":"vous pensiez","41:22:14":"qu’","41:22:15":"Allâh","41:22:16":"ne","41:22:17":"connaît (pas)","41:22:18":"beaucoup","41:22:19":"de ce que","41:22:20":"vous faites.","41:23:1":"Et celle-là (est)","41:23:2":"votre pensée","41:23:3":"que","41:23:4":"vous avez pensée","41:23:5":"au sujet de votre Maître,","41:23:6":"elle vous a faits tomber en ruine,","41:23:7":"vous êtes donc devenus","41:23:8":"parmi","41:23:9":"les perdants.","41:24:1":"Et ensuite, s’","41:24:2":"ils endurent,","41:24:3":"alors Le Feu (est)","41:24:4":"une résidence","41:24:5":"pour eux.","41:24:6":"Et s’","41:24:7":"ils demandent du bien,","41:24:8":"alors ne pas","41:24:9":"ils (sont)","41:24:10":"parmi","41:24:11":"ceux qui reçoivent du bien.","41:25:1":"Et Nous avons désigné","41:25:2":"pour eux","41:25:3":"des camarades","41:25:4":"et ils ont ensuite enjolivé","41:25:5":"pour eux","41:25:6":"ce qui (est)","41:25:7":"devant","41:25:8":"devant eux","41:25:9":"et ce qui (sera)","41:25:10":"après eux","41:25:11":"et est devenue obligatoire","41:25:12":"contre eux","41:25:13":"La Parole","41:25:14":"dans","41:25:15":"des communautés","41:25:16":"(qui) certainement","41:25:17":"sont passées","41:25:18":"[d’]","41:25:19":"avant eux","41:25:20":"parmi","41:25:21":"les djinns","41:25:22":"et les humains.","41:25:23":"Certes, ils","41:25:24":"étaient","41:25:25":"perdants.","41:26:1":"Et ont dit","41:26:2":"ceux qui","41:26:3":"ont mécru :","41:26:4":"« N’","41:26:5":"écoutez (pas)","41:26:6":"à Ce","41:26:7":"[Le] Coran","41:26:8":"et parlez inutilement","41:26:9":"pendant Sa (récitation)","41:26:10":"afin que peut-être vous","41:26:11":"surpasserez.","41:27:1":"Nous ferons donc très certainement goûter","41:27:2":"ceux qui","41:27:3":"ont mécru","41:27:4":"(à) un châtiment","41:27:5":"sévère","41:27:6":"et les récompenserons très certainement sans diminution","41:27:7":"(pour le) pire","41:27:8":"(de) ce qu’","41:27:9":"ils faisaient","41:27:10":"ils faisaient.","41:28:1":"Celle-là (est)","41:28:2":"(la) récompense non-diminuée","41:28:3":"des ennemis","41:28:4":"(d’)Allâh :","41:28:5":"Le Feu.","41:28:6":"(Il y aura) pour eux","41:28:7":"en lui","41:28:8":"(la) demeure","41:28:9":"(de) l’éternité","41:28:10":"(en tant que) récompense non-diminuée","41:28:11":"parce qu’","41:28:12":"ils déniaient tout en sachant","41:28:13":"[en] Nos Versets","41:28:14":"ils déniaient tout en sachant.","41:29:1":"Et diront","41:29:2":"ceux qui","41:29:3":"ont mécru :","41:29:4":"« Notre Maître !","41:29:5":"Montre-nous","41:29:6":"ceux qui","41:29:7":"nous ont égarés","41:29:8":"parmi","41:29:9":"l